{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>慶祝中國共產黨成立105週年大會於7月1日上午10時在人民大會堂隆重舉行。中共中央總書記、國家主席、中央軍委主席習近平向「七一勳章」獲得者頒授勳章並發表重要講話。大會還對全國優秀共產黨員、全國優秀黨務工作者和全國先進基層黨組織進行表彰。</p><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148931920508489728068341.png/G0Asp23DnSBCp21Zdles_zEWV86ZfICGNzQTODc0Ezg\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148931918033719296568079.png/yJywGxPrufTekT_Q5qd-VW1Ss6oLIluZ58XNt-fFzbc\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148931915454091264741650.png/C7Zo0oN5ofIGy0YxpOx6GmWjNmNz9lGnrPcksKz3JLA\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>習近平向「七一勳章」獲得者頒授勳章：</p><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148934632432340992415792.png/OopEdZiiJIOrOPy08zML-ulseNXf3z5mc5v9E3Ob_RM\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148934630154702848251863.png/UrLGeztwAahiPvSpcipuJ7hlOFtQ4HZSPLQaozy0GqM\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148934627860287488928703.png/rM6CHm_mDMKXRM1HQoeTH6IijfVAZOMcU-6nDFPupww\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148934625138053120016597.png/XCR6BsA7LPpfQ9nPQj4YuoG9z_PWXpJiv33g57994Oc\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1148934760798621696210864.png/IFXK4IChERjcc7CIBbXZLkeirU5Bg7xinKxekZysXpE\"/><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>「七一勳章」獲得者乘車前往人民大會堂（點擊播放）：</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-01T03:00:25.661713+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":8,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}